  "content": "<div><img src=\"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/cached_images/cca5699bd7a66a33c1411fbdbae0ad410892b98a.png\" alt=\"功能特性\" width=\"100%\"></div>\n<div style=\"display:flex;text-align:center\"><img src=\"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/8aoMKplv/images/81fcb56d7fc54db831facf5febbdd1e021bb7fcc.gif\" alt=\"锄头动作\" width=\"100%\"></div>\n<div style=\"text-align:center\"><div style=\"text-align:center\"><a href=\"https://discord.gg/CXttaCyGCN\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/cached_images/25b3523cedf0cb3f3c12740f07400b5bc306954b.png\" alt=\"Discord\" width=\"60px\"> </a><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fwww.tiktok.com%252f%2540mypunchymod\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/cached_images/c455866e8b8d992e586e9d61e5cd905dcc6c84de.png\" alt=\"TikTok\" width=\"60px\"> </a><a href=\"https://www.youtube.com/@punchyxp2\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/cached_images/c6ea4d87bf707d2f9f0bf59633d29ebede5c9fd7.png\" alt=\"YouTube\" width=\"60px\"> </a><a href=\"https://github.com/punchy-mod/punchy-wiki/wiki/\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/cached_images/0197a0dce279690de37a1f899b3d25edf9d3bac2.png\" alt=\"GitHub\" width=\"60px\"> </a><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fko-fi.com%252fmodinpunchy\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/cached_images/8a0c2971228a3266c56e4dcdeef1229af0974192.png\" alt=\"Ko-fi\" width=\"60px\"></a></div><br><br><br><div style=\"text-align:center\"><section><p>Punchy! 彻底改变了《我的世界》中战斗和移动的体验。流畅的动画、手持物理效果以及实时调优，为每一个动作增添了重量感、风格与个性。它旨在让一切充满活力，同时不破坏资源包兼容性。</p></section></div><div style=\"text-align:center\"><div><span><span><iframe style=\"width:850px\" src=\"https://www.youtube.com/embed/dvTgIbiwHqc?si=vizVyP9oyUwas2KA\" width=\"560\" height=\"315\" frameborder=\"0\" allowfullscreen=\"allowfullscreen\"></iframe></span></span></div></div><br><div><img src=\"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/cached_images/cca5699bd7a66a33c1411fbdbae0ad410892b98a.png\" alt=\"功能特性\" width=\"100%\"></div><br><div style=\"text-align:center\"><img src=\"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/cached_images/47e0f59a12115269646e828a6f7c65f7139efce1.webp\" alt=\"Better Combat\" width=\"30%\"><br><br><img src=\"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/cached_images/47c36b807e44592bbfd39206911585e92010abc4.gif\" alt=\"Better Combat\" width=\"100%\"><div style=\"text-align:center\"><p>为了与 Better Combat 插件获得<strong>最佳兼容性</strong>，请使用此资源包：</p><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/texture-packs/modded-swords-x-punchy\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/cached_images/b5b655780b2e2a45f484af6e93f268e0c677357c.png\" alt=\"功能特性\" width=\"80px\"></a><br><em>点击查看</em></div></div><br><div><img src=\"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/cached_images/cca5699bd7a66a33c1411fbdbae0ad410892b98a.png\" alt=\"功能特性\" width=\"100%\"></div><br><div style=\"text-align:center\"><img src=\"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/cached_images/9c571a5ef1176c92ce66a7157c33dd1779420632.png\" alt=\"功能特性\" width=\"300px\"></div><br><div style=\"text-align:center\"><p>不再需要单独的资源包，<br>所有<strong>明确的 Punchy! 兼容性功能</strong>都维护在一个单一的 Modrinth 集合中。</p><p>该集合保持更新，并包含官方推荐的兼容包。</p></div><div style=\"text-align:center\"><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fwww.punchymod.com%252f%2523compat\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/cached_images/1295a4a95570fdd19437f2af3d6edb9ef0cf9cd1_0.webp\" alt=\"Punchy! 兼容集合\" width=\"320\"></a><p><em>点击查看完整的 Modrinth 集合</em></p></div><br><div><img src=\"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/cached_images/cca5699bd7a66a33c1411fbdbae0ad410892b98a.png\" alt=\"功能特性\" width=\"100%\"></div><br><div style=\"text-align:center\"><img src=\"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/cached_images/2bb0d76282288d92aa6d210cac2db4384ac8f439.png\" alt=\"功能特性\" width=\"400px\"><section><h3>致谢</h3>感谢 Godku 提供的帮助。<br>感谢 Jaredlll08 提供的多加载器模板：<a href=\"https://github.com/jaredlll08\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Jaredlll08 GitHub 页面</a><br>感谢 Lunggolfs 提供的社交连接图标包：<a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252flunggolfs.itch.io%252fsocial-connect-icons-pack\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Lunggolfs 网站</a><br>感谢 CRV6 制作的预告片及精彩的音乐：<a href=\"https://www.youtube.com/@CRV6-Music/featured\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">CRV6 YouTube 频道</a><br>感谢 Craftandoof 提供的超棒的苏醒动画：<a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fuser%252fcraftandoof\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Craftandoof Modrinth 主页</a><br>感谢 themodderg 设计的简洁且标志性的模组图标：<a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fuser%252fthemodderg\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">themodderg Modrinth 主页</a><br>感谢 choccy_milk55 设计的酷炫模组开场动画：<a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fuser%252fchoccy_milk55\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">choccy_milk55 Modrinth 主页</a></section><br><section><h3>许可证</h3>版权所有 (All Rights Reserved)<br>您被允许将此模组包含在 Modrinth 或 CurseForge 模组包中，无需征得许可。<br>禁止重新分发 jar 文件（请勿在其他地方分享 jar 文件）。</section></div></div>",
